### 🚀 Technical Implementation: The "Guardian Brain" Service
To make the **Manifesto** functional, the code needs to run as a **systemd service** so it is impossible for the "Guardian" to sleep.

**1. Create the Service File:**
`sudo nano /etc/systemd/system/guardian.service`

**2. Paste this configuration:**
```ini
[Unit]
Description=Satoshi's Bride Guardian Brain (ShalomXEdge)
After=network.target

[Service]
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /home/pi/cutie_guardian.py
WorkingDirectory=/home/pi
StandardOutput=inherit
StandardError=inherit
Restart=always
User=pi

[Install]
WantedBy=multi-user.target
```

**3. Enable the Vow:**
```bash
sudo systemctl enable guardian.service
sudo systemctl start guardian.service
```

